Credits
-------
usbkill-ng is an independent rewrite inspired by "usbkill" by Hephaestos
<hephaestos@riseup.net>, https://github.com/hephaest0s/usbkill (GPL-3.0-or-later).
The idea, the name and the goal of the original project are credited to its author. usbkill-ng
was written from an audit of that project; it replaces its USB detection, configuration,
actions and packaging, and deliberately does not carry over its file-shredding, RAM/swap
wiping or self-delete features.

Use only on computers you own or are authorised to administer.
